==Description==
The '''Korblox General''' was a tanky enemy that appeared in [[Huevous Hunt]] as part of [[The Hunt Event]]. It had a high amount of health, though it was quite slow, only being faster than the [[Korblox Warrior (The Hunt)|Korblox Warrior]] and [[Korblox Deathwalker (The Hunt)|Korblox Deathwalker]]. On some waves, the '''Korblox General''' spawned as a hidden or lead enemy. Additionally, it also had the stun, freeze and burn immunities on some waves. At times, it could have four of these immunities at once.

==Appearance==
The '''Korblox General''' was a giant skeleton that floated above the path. It had a grey skull with neon blue eyes. It also had neon blue arms and had no torso or legs. It wore grey pants, chestplate and shoulder-pads. It also had metal armbands and multiple blue spikes on its armor. 

==Strategy==
*As the '''Korblox General''' has quite high health, the [[Minigunner]] and [[Accelerator]] are recommended against it.
**Additionally, as these towers have both hidden detection and lead detection, they can always deal damage to the '''Korblox General''' regardless of its immunities.
*The [[Commander]] and [[DJ Booth]] can be quite useful at boosting the firerate and range of towers respectively.
**Stalling towers like the [[Warden]], [[Trapper]] or [[Freezer]] can also be used, though because of its slow speed this is not needed.
***Additionally, on some waves it gains the [[Freeze Immunity]], making it completely immune to being frozen and chilled by freezing towers. Stunning towers will also only slow it down as it gains the [[Stun Immunity]].

